<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-layout">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <span class="about-eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT JEVANS CONSULTING</span>
      <h2 id="about-title">Good technology should make business simpler.</h2>
      <p class="about-lede">
        A straightforward, personal approach to websites and digital support.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm an independent consultant with a background in software development,
        business systems and technical support. I enjoy understanding how things
        work, solving problems and turning ideas into practical solutions.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started Jevans Consulting to bring that experience to small - medium businesses
        that want a better online presence without the complexity of dealing with
        a large agency. Whether it's creating a new website, improving an existing
        one or taking care of the technical details, my aim is to make the process
        clear, useful and straightforward.
      </p>
      <p>
        You'll work directly with me from the first conversation through to launch
        and beyond. No unnecessary jargon, no being passed from person to person –
        just practical advice and support shaped around your business.
      </p>
      <div class="about-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-open-contact>Let's talk</button>
        <a class="about-link" href="#process">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

